kwise), and\n\n- the positive direction is *clockwise* for the *inner* curves ${C}_{2}$ and ${C}_{3}$ (because the region $D$ is always on the left as we traverse ${C}_{2}$ and ${C}_{3}$ clockwise).\n\nThe diagram below shows the positive orientations of all three curves.\n\n![](images/fd/fd221ae68fc4983fb0a3f7a745154764e5c0081b2b9b66e7f8ad4a150a8b3bc5.png)\n\nNotice that the positive orientations of the inner curves ${C}_{2}$ and ${C}_{3}$ are opposite to those stated in the question.\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{∂D}F\\cdot \\text{d}r & ={∮}_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{∮}_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r-{∮}_{{C}_{3}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r \\\\  & =1-5-(-3) \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186369462 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5d7cf9a0-e8a9-528c-9faf-b2259025de3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186369464} {:answer/id #uuid "ce1af42a-4bf9-5730-a278-44c2bcb271c9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "19" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186369465} {:answer/id #uuid "26f52db4-19ad-52bc-bdea-a43ddccabe76" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186369466} {:answer/id #uuid "74b55cd4-e132-5c25-af68-783e5644f0be" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186369467} {:answer/id #uuid "5901a191-1792-51d7-92cf-8ae7fe658d89" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186369468}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5901a191-1792-51d7-92cf-8ae7fe658d89" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186369468} :answer-field/id #uuid "d0c368b0-4e71-50a8-b81a-cf6d68ab083b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186369463}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ca63e980-b1ab-5e66-